# A vault must never be committed. These rules cover the encrypted vault and the
# non-secret sidecar wherever they might be pointed with INKCAST_VAULT_PATH, and
# they are duplicated in the repo-root .gitignore — belt and braces, because the
# cost of one leaked file here is every key the user owns.
vault.json
*.vault.json
vault.json.tmp-*
keyvault-meta.json
.inkcast/

# Scratch directories the tests create.
test/.tmp-*/
